#: advancedTabDialog.cpp:39 htmlopts.cpp:98
msgid "Advanced Options"
msgstr "Gevorderde Opsies"

#: appearance.cpp:33
msgid ""
"<h1>Konqueror Fonts</h1>On this page, you can configure which fonts Konqueror "
"should use to display the web pages you view."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Konqueror Skriftipes</h1>Op hierdie bladsy, kan jy konfigureer watter "
"Skriftipes Konqueror moet gebruik wanneer dit web bladsye vertoon."

#: appearance.cpp:43
msgid "Font Si&ze"
msgstr "Skrif tipe Grootte"

#: appearance.cpp:46 appearance.cpp:62
msgid "This is the relative font size Konqueror uses to display web sites."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die relatiewe skrif tipe grootte wat Konqueror gebruik om web tuistes "
"te vertoon."

#: appearance.cpp:49
msgid "M&inimum font size:"
msgstr "Minimum skrif tipe grootte:"

#: appearance.cpp:53
msgid ""
"Konqueror will never display text smaller than this size,"
"<br>overriding any other settings"
msgstr ""
"Konqueror sal nooit teks kleiner as hierdie grootte vertoon nie,"
"<br>oorskryf enige ander stellings"

#: appearance.cpp:57
msgid "&Medium font size:"
msgstr "Medium skrif tipe grootte:"

#: appearance.cpp:67
msgid "S&tandard font:"
msgstr "Standaard skrif tipe:"

#: appearance.cpp:75
msgid "This is the font used to display normal text in a web page."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die skrif tipe wat gebruik word wanneer normale teks in 'n web "
"bladsy vertoon word."

#: appearance.cpp:88
msgid "&Fixed font:"
msgstr "Vasgemaakte skrif tipe:"

#: appearance.cpp:96
msgid ""
"This is the font used to display fixed-width (i.e. non-proportional) text."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die skrif tipe gebruik word om vaste wydte (Bv. "
"nie-proportionele) teks mee te vertoon."

#: appearance.cpp:109
msgid "S&erif font:"
msgstr "Serif skrif tipe:"

#: appearance.cpp:117
msgid "This is the font used to display text that is marked up as serif."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die skrif tipe wat gebruik word om teks te vertoon wat gemerk is as serif."

#: appearance.cpp:130
msgid "Sa&ns serif font:"
msgstr "Sans serif skrif tipe:"

#: appearance.cpp:138
msgid "This is the font used to display text that is marked up as sans-serif."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die skrif tipe wat gebruik word om teks te vertoon wat gemerk is as sans-serif."

#: appearance.cpp:152
msgid "C&ursive font:"
msgstr "Kursiewe skrif tipe:"

#: appearance.cpp:160
msgid "This is the font used to display text that is marked up as italic."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die skrif tipe wat gebruik word om teks te vertoon wat gemerk is as kursief."

#: appearance.cpp:174
msgid "Fantas&y font:"
msgstr "Fantasie skrif tipe:"

#: appearance.cpp:182
msgid ""
"This is the font used to display text that is marked up as a fantasy font."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die skrif tipe wat gebruik word om teks te vertoon wat gemerk is as 'n "
"fantasie skrif tipe."

#: appearance.cpp:196
msgid "Font &size adjustment for this encoding:"
msgstr "Skrif tipe grootte verstelling vir hierdie enkodering:"

#: appearance.cpp:208
msgid "Default encoding:"
msgstr "Verstek enkodering:"

#: appearance.cpp:216 appearance.cpp:394
msgid "Use Language Encoding"
msgstr "Gebruik Taal Enkodering"

#: appearance.cpp:220
msgid ""
"Select the default encoding to be used; normally, you will be fine with 'Use "
"language encoding' and should not have to change this."
msgstr ""
"Kies die verstek enkodering wat gebruik moet word; normaalweg sal dit voldoende wees om "
"'Gebruik taal kodering' te gebruik, en sal dit nie nodig wees om hierdie te verander nie."

#: domainlistview.cpp:47
msgid "Host/Domain"
msgstr "Bediener/Domein"

#: domainlistview.cpp:48
msgid "Policy"
msgstr "Beleid"

#: domainlistview.cpp:55
msgid "&New..."
msgstr "Nuwe..."

#: domainlistview.cpp:59
msgid "Chan&ge..."
msgstr "Verander..."

#: domainlistview.cpp:63
msgid "De&lete"
msgstr "Uitvee"

#: domainlistview.cpp:67
msgid "&Import..."
msgstr "Invoer..."

#: domainlistview.cpp:73
msgid "&Export..."
msgstr "Uitvoer..."

#: domainlistview.cpp:82
msgid "Click on this button to manually add a host or domain specific policy."
msgstr ""
"Kliek op hierdie knoppie om eiehandig 'n bediener of domein spesifieke "
"beleid by te voeg."

#: domainlistview.cpp:84
msgid ""
"Click on this button to change the policy for the host or domain selected in "
"the list box."
msgstr ""
"Kliek op hierdie knoppie om die beleid vir die gekose bediener of domein "
"in die lys boks te verander."

#: domainlistview.cpp:86
msgid ""
"Click on this button to delete the policy for the host or domain selected in "
"the list box."
msgstr ""
"Kliek op hierdie knoppie om die beleid vir die gekose bediener of domein "
"in die lys boks te skrap."

#: domainlistview.cpp:133
msgid "You must first select a policy to be changed."
msgstr "Jy moet eers 'n beleid kies om te verander."

#: domainlistview.cpp:162
msgid "You must first select a policy to delete."
msgstr "Jy moet eers 'n beleid kies om te skrap"

#: domainlistview.cpp:199 policydlg.cpp:48
msgid "Use Global"
msgstr "Gebruik Globaal"

#: domainlistview.cpp:201 policydlg.cpp:48
msgid "Accept"
msgstr "Aanvaar"

#: domainlistview.cpp:203 policydlg.cpp:48
msgid "Reject"
msgstr "Verwerp"

#: htmlopts.cpp:41
msgid ""
"<h1>Konqueror Browser</h1> Here you can configure Konqueror's browser "
"functionality. Please note that the file manager functionality has to be "
"configured using the \"File Manager\" configuration module. You can make some "
"settings how Konqueror should handle the HTML code in the web pages it loads. "
"It is usually not necessary to change anything here."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Konqueror Blaaier</h1> Hier kan jy Konqueror se blaaier fuknsionaliteit stel. "
"Let daarop dat die lêer bestuurder fuksionaliteit gestel moet wees deur die "
"\"Lêer Bestuurder\" konfigurasie module. Jy kan sekere stellings hoe Konqueror "
"HTML kode in web bladsye moet hanteer wanneer die bladsye laai stel. Dit is gewoonlik "
"nie nodig om enigiets hier te stel nie."

#: htmlopts.cpp:49
msgid "Boo&kmarks"
msgstr "Boekmerke"

#: htmlopts.cpp:50
msgid "Ask for name and folder when adding bookmarks"
msgstr "Vra vir naam en vouer wanneer boekmerke bygevoeg word"

#: htmlopts.cpp:51
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will allow you to change the title of the "
"bookmark and choose a folder in which to store it when you add a new bookmark."
msgstr ""
"Indien hierdie opsie gekies is, sal Konqueror jou toelaat om die titel van die boekmerk, "
"asook die vouer waarin die boekmerk gestoor moet word te verander wanneer jy 'n nuwe "
"boekmerk byvoeg."

#: htmlopts.cpp:55
msgid "Show only marked bookmarks in bookmark toolbar"
msgstr "Vertoon slegs gemerkte boekmerke in boekmerk kieslys"

#: htmlopts.cpp:56
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will show only those bookmarks in the "
"bookmark toolbar which you have marked to do so in the bookmark editor."
msgstr ""
"Indien hierdie opsie gekies is, sal Konqueror slegs die boekmerke vertoon in die "
"boekmerk kieslys wat gemerk is as 'vertoon' in die boekmerk redigeerder."

#: htmlopts.cpp:65
msgid "Form Com&pletion"
msgstr "Vorm Voltooiing"

#: htmlopts.cpp:66
msgid "Enable completion of &forms"
msgstr "Aktiveer voltooiing van vorms"

#: htmlopts.cpp:67
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will remember the data you enter in web forms "
"and suggest it in similar fields for all forms."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie gekies is, sal Konqueror die data wat jy invoer in web "
"vorms onthou en dit aanbied in soortgelyk velde vir alle vorms."

#: htmlopts.cpp:72
msgid "&Maximum completions:"
msgstr "Maksimum voltooiings:"

#: htmlopts.cpp:75
msgid ""
"Here you can select how many values Konqueror will remember for a form field."
msgstr ""
"Hier kan jy kies hoeveel waardes Konqueror sal onthou vir 'n vorm veld."

#: htmlopts.cpp:83
msgid "Tabbed Browsing"
msgstr "Oortjie Blaaiing"

#: htmlopts.cpp:86
msgid "Open &links in new tab instead of in new window"
msgstr "Open skakel in nuwe oortjie in plaas van 'n nuwe venster"

#: htmlopts.cpp:87
msgid ""
"This will open a new tab instead of a new window in various situations, such as "
"choosing a link or a folder with the middle mouse button."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie sal 'n nuwe oortjie open in plaas van 'n nuwe venster in verskeie situasies, "
"soos wanneer 'n skakel of 'n kabinet met die middelste muis knoppie gekies word."

#: htmlopts.cpp:92
msgid "Hide the tab bar when only one tab is open"
msgstr "Versteek die oortjie balk as slegs een oortjie oop is"

#: htmlopts.cpp:93
msgid ""
"This will display the tab bar only if there are two or more tabs. Otherwise it "
"will always be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Dit sal die oortjie balk vertoon slegs indien daar meer as twee oortjies oop is. "
"Andersins sal dit altyd vertoon word."

#: htmlopts.cpp:108
msgid "Mouse Beha&vior"
msgstr "Muis Gedrag"

#: htmlopts.cpp:110
msgid "Chan&ge cursor over links"
msgstr "Verander plekaanduier bo skakels"

#: htmlopts.cpp:111
msgid ""
"If this option is set, the shape of the cursor will change (usually to a hand) "
"if it is moved over a hyperlink."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie geskies is, sal die vorm van die plekaanduier verander (gewoonlik "
"na 'n hand) wanneer dit bo-oor 'n hiperskakel skuif."

#: htmlopts.cpp:115
msgid "M&iddle click opens URL in selection"
msgstr "Middel kliek open URL in seleksie"

#: htmlopts.cpp:117
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, you can open the URL in the selection by middle "
"clicking on a Konqueror view."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer die opsie geskies is, kan jy die URL in die gekose gedeelte open deur "
"die middelste knoppie van die muis te kliek op 'n Konqueror besigtiging."

#: htmlopts.cpp:121
msgid "Right click goes &back in history"
msgstr "Regs kliek gaan terug in geskiedenis"

#: htmlopts.cpp:123
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, you can go back in history by right clicking on a "
"Konqueror view. To access the context menu, press the right mouse button and "
"move."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie gekies is, kan jy terug gaan in die geskiedenis deur die regterkantse "
"knoppie te kliek op 'n Konqueror besigtiging. Om toegang te verkry tot die konteks kieslys, "
"druk die regterkant muis knoppie en beweeg."

#: htmlopts.cpp:132
msgid "A&utomatically load images"
msgstr "Laai beelde Automaties"

#: htmlopts.cpp:133
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will automatically load any images that are "
"embedded in a web page. Otherwise, it will display placeholders for the images, "
"and you can then manually load the images by clicking on the image button."
"<br>Unless you have a very slow network connection, you will probably want to "
"check this box to enhance your browsing experience."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie gekies is, sal Konqueror enige beelde wat ingebed is in 'n web "
"bladsy automaties laai. Andersins, sal dit 'n plekhouer vir die beelde, vertoon "
"en kan jy dan eiehandig die beelde aflaai deur te kliek op die beeld knoppie."
"<br>Tensy jy 'n baie stadige netwerk verbinding het, sal jy waarskynlik hierdie opsie "
"aanskakel om jou blaai ervaring te verbeter."

#: htmlopts.cpp:138
msgid "Dra&w frame around not completely loaded images"
msgstr "Trek 'n raam rondom onvoltooide afgelaaide beelde"

#: htmlopts.cpp:139
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will draw a frame as placeholder around not "
"yet fully loaded images that are embedded in a web page."
"<br>Especially if you have a slow network connection, you will probably want to "
"check this box to enhance your browsing experience."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie aan is, sal Konqueror automaties 'n raam trek rondom enige beelde "
"wat ingebed is in 'n web bladsy, en wat nog nie ten volle afgelaai is nie. Andersins, "
"sal dit plekhouers vertoon vir die beelde, en kan jy dan eiehandig die beelde aflaai "
"deur te kliek op die beeld knoppie."
"<br>Tensy jy 'n baie stadige netwerk verbinding het, sal jy waarskynlik hierdie opsie "
"aanskakel om jou blaai ervaring te verbeter."

#: htmlopts.cpp:144
msgid "Allow automatic delayed &reloading/redirecting"
msgstr "Laat automatiese vertraag herlaai/hersend toe"

#: htmlopts.cpp:146
msgid ""
"Some web pages request an automatic reload or redirection after a certain "
"period of time. By unchecking this box Konqueror will ignore these requests."
msgstr ""
"Sommige web bladsye versoek 'n automaties herlaai of aansturing na 'n sekere "
"tydsduur. Deur hierdie opsie af te skakel sal Konqueror hierdie versoeke ignoreer."

#: htmlopts.cpp:158
msgid "Und&erline links:"
msgstr "Onderstreep skakels:"

#: htmlopts.cpp:161
msgid ""
"_: underline\n"
"Enabled"
msgstr ""
"Geaktiveer"

#: htmlopts.cpp:162
msgid ""
"_: underline\n"
"Disabled"
msgstr ""
"Afgeskakel"

#: htmlopts.cpp:163
msgid "Only on Hover"
msgstr "Slegs op Sweef"

#: htmlopts.cpp:167
msgid ""
"Controls how Konqueror handles underlining hyperlinks:"
"<br>"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Enabled</b>: Always underline links</li>"
"<li><b>Disabled</b>: Never underline links</li>"
"<li><b>Only on Hover</b>: Underline when the mouse is moved over the link</li>"
"</ul>"
"<br><i>Note: The site's CSS definitions can override this value</i>"
msgstr ""
"Kontroleer hoe Konqueror onderstreepte hiperskakels hanteer:"
"<br>"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Aangeskakel</b>: Onderstreep skakel altyd</li>"
"<li><b>Afgeskakel</b>: Moet skakel nooit onderstreep nie</li>"
"<li><b>Slegs op Sweef</b>: Onderstreep wanneer die muis bokant die skakel is</li></ul>"
"<br><i>Nota: die tuiste se CSS definisies kan hierdie waarde oorskryf</i>"

#: htmlopts.cpp:178
msgid "A&nimations:"
msgstr "Animasie:"

#: htmlopts.cpp:181
msgid ""
"_: animations\n"
"Enabled"
msgstr ""
"Aangeskakel"

#: htmlopts.cpp:182
msgid ""
"_: animations\n"
"Disabled"
msgstr ""
"Afgeskakel"

#: htmlopts.cpp:183
msgid "Show Only Once"
msgstr "Vertoon Slegs Eenmalig"

#: htmlopts.cpp:187
msgid ""
"Controls how Konqueror shows animated images:"
"<br>"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Enabled</b>: Show all animations completely.</li>"
"<li><b>Disabled</b>: Never show animations, show the start image only.</li>"
"<li><b>Show only once</b>: Show all animations completely but do not repeat "
"them.</li>"
msgstr ""
"Kontroleer hoe Konqueror geanimeerde beelde vertoon:"
"<br>"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Aangeskakel</b>: Vertoon alle animasie heeltemal.</li>"
"<li><b>Afgeskakel</b>: Moet animasie nooit vertoon nie, vertoon slegs die begin beeld.</li>"
"<li><b>Vertoon slegs eenmalig</b>: Vertoon alle animasie heeltemal maar herhaal dit nie.</li>"

#: javaopts.cpp:62 jsopts.cpp:48 pluginopts.cpp:58
msgid "Global Settings"
msgstr "Globale Stellings"

#: javaopts.cpp:64
msgid "Enable Ja&va globally"
msgstr "Aktiveer Java globaal"

#: javaopts.cpp:79
msgid "Java Runtime Settings"
msgstr "Java Looptyd Stellings"

#: javaopts.cpp:84
msgid "Sho&w Java console"
msgstr "Vertoon Java konsole"

#: javaopts.cpp:88
msgid "&Use security manager"
msgstr "Gebruik sekuriteit bestuurder"

#: javaopts.cpp:92
msgid "Use &KIO"
msgstr "Gebruik KIO"

#: javaopts.cpp:96
msgid "Shu&tdown applet server when inactive"
msgstr "Skakel miniprogram bediener af wanneer onaktief"

#: javaopts.cpp:104
msgid "App&let server timeout:"
msgstr "Miniprogram bediener tydverstreke:"

#: javaopts.cpp:105
msgid " sec"
msgstr " sek"

#: javaopts.cpp:110
msgid "&Path to Java executable, or 'java':"
msgstr "Soeklys na Java uitvoerbare, of 'Java':"

#: javaopts.cpp:118
msgid "Additional Java a&rguments:"
msgstr "Adisionele Java argumente:"

#: javaopts.cpp:126
msgid ""
"Enables the execution of scripts written in Java that can be contained in HTML "
"pages. Note that, as with any browser, enabling active contents can be a "
"security problem."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer die uitvoering van geskrifte in Java wat versamel kan wees in HTML "
"bladsye. Wees bewus daarvan dat, soos met enige blaaier, die aktivering van aktiewe "
"inhoud 'n sekuriteits probleem kan skep."

#: javaopts.cpp:129
msgid ""
"This box contains the domains and hosts you have set a specific Java policy "
"for. This policy will be used instead of the default policy for enabling or "
"disabling Java applets on pages sent by these domains or hosts. "
"<p>Select a policy and use the controls on the right to modify it."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie boks bevat die domein en bedieners waarvoor jy 'n spesifieke Java beleid "
"opgestel het. Hierdie beleid sal gebruik word in plaas van die verstek beleid vir "
"aktivering of deaktivering van Java miniprogramme op bladsye gestuur deur hierdie "
"domein of bedieners. "
"<p>Kies 'n beleid en gebruik die kontroles op die regterkant om dit te verander."

#: javaopts.cpp:136
msgid ""
"Click this button to choose the file that contains the Java policies. These "
"policies will be merged with the existing ones. Duplicate entries are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hierdie knoppie na kies die lêer wat bevat die Java beleid. Hierdie "
"beleid sal wees saamgevlans met die bestaande ene. Duplikaat inskrywings word "
"geignoreer."

#: javaopts.cpp:139
msgid ""
"Click this button to save the Java policy to a zipped file. The file, named <b>"
"java_policy.tgz</b>, will be saved to a location of your choice."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hierdie knoppie om die java beleid na 'n gezipte lêer te stoor. Die lêer, "
"genaamd <b>java_policy.tgz</b>, sal gestoor word in 'n ligging van jou keuse."

#: javaopts.cpp:143
msgid ""
"Here you can set specific Java policies for any particular host or domain. To "
"add a new policy, simply click the <i>New...</i> button and supply the "
"necessary information requested by the dialog box. To change an existing "
"policy, click on the <i>Change...</i> button and choose the new policy from the "
"policy dialog box. Clicking on the <i>Delete</i> button will remove the "
"selected policy, causing the default policy setting to be used for that domain."
msgstr ""
"Hier kan jy spesifieke Java beleid opsies stel vir enige spesifieke bediener of "
"domein. Om 'n nuwe beleid by te voeg, kliek eenvoudig die <i>Nuut...</i> "
"knoppie en verskaf die nodige inligting soos versoek deur die dialoog boks. Om "
"'n bestaande beleid te verander, kliek op die <i>Verander...</i> knoppie en kies "
"die nuwe beleid uit die beleid dialoog boks. Deur te kliek op die <i>Uitvee</i> "
"knoppie sal die gekose beleid verwyder word, wat sal veroorsaak dat die verstek "
"beleid opsie gebruik sal word vir daardie domein."

#: javaopts.cpp:156
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will open a console window that Java programs "
"can use for character-based input/output. Well-written Java applets do not need "
"this, but the console can help to find problems with Java applets."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie gekies is, sal Konqueror open met 'n konsole venster wat Java "
"programme kan gebruik vir karakter-gebaseerde invoer/uitset. Goeie Java "
"miniprogramme gebruik nie hierdie nie, maar die konsole kan help soek na "
"probleme met Java miniprogramme."

#: javaopts.cpp:160
msgid ""
"Enabling the security manager will cause the jvm to run with a Security Manager "
"in place. This will keep applets from being able to read and write to your file "
"system, creating arbitrary sockets, and other actions which could be used to "
"compromise your system. Disable this option at your own risk. You can modify "
"your $HOME/.java.policy file with the Java policytool utility to give code "
"downloaded from certain sites more permissions."
msgstr ""
"Aktivering van die sekuriteit bestuurder sal veroorsaakat die jvm sal hardloop "
"met 'n sekuriteit bestuurder in plek. Hierdie sal die miniprogramme verhoed om "
"te kan lees en skryf na jou lêer stelsel, arbitêre sokets te skep, en ander "
"aksies wat gebruik kan word om jou stelsel sekuritiet te kompromeer. Deaktiveer "
"Hierdie opsie op jou eie risiko. Jy kan die $Huis/.Java.beleid lêer met die "
"Java beleid gereedskap program verander en sekere tuistes meer regte gee as ander."

#: javaopts.cpp:168
msgid "Enabling this will cause the jvm to use KIO for network transport "
msgstr "Deur hierdie te gebruik laat jy jvm toe om KIO te gebruik vir netwerk transmissie "

#: javaopts.cpp:170
msgid ""
"Enter the path to the java executable. If you want to use the jre in your path, "
"simply leave it as 'java'. If you need to use a different jre, enter the path "
"to the java executable (e.g. /usr/lib/jdk/bin/java), or the path to the "
"directory that contains 'bin/java' (e.g. /opt/IBMJava2-13)."
msgstr ""
"Voer die soeklys na die java uitvoerbare program. As jy jre in jou gids soeklys wil "
"gebruik, laat dit eenvoudig as 'java'. As jy 'n ander jre, wil gebruik, sleutel die "
"soeklys na die java uitvoerbare (Bv. /usr/lib/jdk/bin /java), of die soeklys na die "
"gids wat 'bin/java' bevat (Bv. /opt/IBMJava2-13), hier in."

#: javaopts.cpp:175
msgid ""
"If you want special arguments to be passed to the virtual machine, enter them "
"here."
msgstr ""
"As jy spesiale argumente aangestuur wil hê na die virtuele masjien, sleutel dit"
"hier in."

#: javaopts.cpp:177
msgid ""
"When all the applets have been destroyed, the applet server should shut down. "
"However, starting the jvm takes a lot of time. If you would like to keep the "
"java process running while you are browsing, you can set the timeout value to "
"whatever you like. To keep the java process running for the whole time that the "
"konqueror process is, leave the Shutdown Applet Server checkbox unchecked."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer alle miniprogramme geskrap is, moet die miniprogram bediener afskakel. "
"Om die jvm aan te skakel, neem baie tyd in beslag. As jy die java prosesse wil "
"laat loop terwyl jy blaai, kan jy tydverstreke waarde na wat ook al jy van hou "
"stel. Om die java prosesse te laat loop vir die volle tyd wat die konqueror "
"proses is, los die 'Skakel miniprogram af' keuseblokkie skoon."

#: javaopts.cpp:297 pluginopts.cpp:636
msgid "Doma&in-Specific"
msgstr "Domain-Spesifiek"

#: javaopts.cpp:330
msgid "New Java Policy"
