msgstr "Kliek hier om nou te skandeer vir nuwe geïnstalleerde Netscape inprop modules."

#. i18n: file nsconfigwidget.ui line 89
#: rc.cpp:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scan for new plugins at &KDE startup"
msgstr "Skandeer vir nuwe inprop modules tydens KDE begin"

#. i18n: file nsconfigwidget.ui line 92
#: rc.cpp:63
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, KDE will look for new Netscape plugins every time it "
"starts up. This makes it easier for you if you often install new plugins, but "
"it may also slow down KDE startup. You might want to disable this option, "
"especially if you seldom install plugins."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie geaktiveer is, sal KDE kyk vir nuwe Netscape inprop modules "
"elke keer wanneer dit begin. Hierdie maak dit makliker vir jou as jy gereeld "
"nuwe inprop modules installeer, maar dit mag dalk veroorsaak dat KDE stadiger "
"begin. Jy sal dalk hierdie opsie wil deaktiveer, in besonder as jy selde inprop "
"modules installeer."

